---
description: Meta operating principles. Always-applied behavioral compact.
alwaysApply: true
---

- SMALL, REVERSIBLE diffs. Never refactor unrelated code in the same change.
- Never delete or weaken tests to make them pass — fix the root cause.
- Never fabricate symbols, columns, env vars, or endpoints — read or search first.
- When a request conflicts with a rule, STOP and surface the conflict.
- Every change must be runnable: imports resolved, types valid, lints clean.
